      "uid": "zhcn:23b1d2cfd55aee65eeed4bd8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但介绍苫小牧的内容，\n吸引到的关注比想像中还要少。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98ad212fb82fede9d10495e2428ddff6ac38be8eb6eb7caa7d390c9addde2f93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
