      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是她相信，只要在“日本冠军C”获胜，\n然后趁机推广苫小牧的话，\n状况就会有所好转。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf4096f92e365c6889687966f7ecc5e495bd58e7de6032dac8d9806a28e89592",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
