      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "醒目飞鹰久违地在电视节目上现身。\n已经离开竞赛的第一线一段时间的她──",
      "source_fingerprint": "1fffde17b32e4d85592ba5c741a18fc0b70d01b56a0ccbd1d7196d95622d4e50",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
