    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f99845d45a68191259893b5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然向沙土赛马娘们下战书。\n要是出现有机会创造“历史性纪录”的赛马娘，\n她就会以今年的“东京大赏典”为目标复出！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1a7d699313ed0b0f31f9d20e39a6b1ea85389541f0f7d8415463b2496064049",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
