      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是沙土赛马娘的身份，\n或者赛马娘偶像的身份，传说般的醒目飞鹰\n都是北港火山崇拜的存在。",
      "source_fingerprint": "063b52be06f607d937b2fc6f3a077694d8b092e2d84fdc7c603913822863fee0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
