      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一行人来到苫小牧。\n醒目飞鹰拜托北港火山，\n带她前往充满北港火山回忆的地方。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b0f7f601377d45d4dee60e6bc39e4eb8c4069f007d36680b79e39f8be885615",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
